# Testing

- Add the critical tests named in the milestone file. A milestone is not done without them.
- Test behavior: illegal transitions, idempotency, webhook signature failure, rules denying client writes.
- Do not assert on full widget trees or on log text.
- Characterization tests come before a refactor of an existing screen.
- Fakes implement the same port as the real adapter. Do not spin up Cashfree or Maps in unit tests.
- Emulator tests cover Security Rules for any collection the milestone adds.
- A broken test is a failed task. Do not delete it to go green.
- `flutter test` and `pytest` must pass for the areas you changed before you open the PR.

Detail: `docs/prd/20-testing.md`.
